  "description": "Electric. Sporty. Practical. Our TREKKING 3 HIGH is made for your entry into the eBike business – this is ensured not only by its comfortable geometry, but also by its reliable component mix. Whether it’s your way to work or an evening ride through the forest – with the powerful Bosch Performance Line Smart System motor, you’ll always have the wind at your back. Reliable shifting and braking components also offer you maximum comfort. The StVZO-compliant* equipment with luggage rack, lights and mudguards leaves nothing to be desired on the usual daily rides. In short: this Trekking eBike is the best proof of why electric cycling is so successful – and shows why it’s high time you got into the eBike business. The TREKKING 3 is available in MID and HIGH frame shapes.\n\n*For countries outside Germany, please check your local road traffic regulations for compliance.",
